### PRAMAAN API — open in VS Code with the REST Client extension and click "Send Request"
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health

### 1. GENUINE SEALED CIRCULAR -> GREEN, no model inference
POST {{host}}/api/v1/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"content": "Members are hereby notified of revised surveillance measures applicable to securities in the SME segment with effect from the settlement cycle commencing 20 July 2026."}

### 2. FORGED SEBI CIRCULAR -> RED. Not in the log => never issued. No model ran.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"content": "OFFICIAL SEBI CIRCULAR: Priority IPO allotment approved for select investors. Visit https://sebi-india-verify.com to claim your allotment."}

### 3. FINFLUENCER PHISHING -> RED, six named signals
POST {{host}}/api/v1/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"content": "SEBI approved! Guaranteed 40% returns. I am SEBI registered, reg no INA999999999. Only 5 seats left! Join my Telegram group now. Pay to rahul@ybl"}

### 4. THE MONEY SHOT — perfect deepfake, ungrounded claim. Zero phishing keywords.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"content": "Reliance has announced a massive buyback at a 30% premium."}

### Seal a new artefact at source
POST {{host}}/api/v1/seal
Content-Type: application/json

{"issuer_did": "did:pramaan:nse", "artefact_type": "circular", "title": "NSE/SURV/2026/042 — Test Circular", "content": "This is a genuine circular issued by the exchange."}

### Signed Tree Head
GET {{host}}/api/v1/log/sth

### Log entries
GET {{host}}/api/v1/log/entries

### Merkle inclusion proof (client-verifiable — no trust in the operator required)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/log/proof/1

### Authorised issuers
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issuers
